    "notes": "Anthem operates under various names across the country and provides individual, employer and Medicare plans. The point to remember is the various names. A client may describe their insurance with a different brand name than the one on a lien letter, and it can still be the same company. When names do not match, confirm before you assume it is a separate lien or a mistake."
